Multichar_Symbols
  +N    ! noun
  +Adj  ! adjective
  +Pron ! pronoun
  +Num  ! numeral
  +V    ! verb
  +Part ! participle

  +Sg   ! singular
  +Pl   ! plural

  +Nom  ! nominative
  +Gen  ! genitive
  +Dat  ! dative
  +Akk  ! accusative

  +Masc ! masculine
  +Fem  ! feminine
  +Neut ! neuter

  +Pres ! present tense
  +Pret ! preterite tense
  +Inf  ! infinitive

  +P1   ! 1st person
  +P2   ! 2nd person
  +P3   ! 3rd person

  ! Flag diacritics for divergence layers
  @P.standard.prusaspira@
  @P.standard.twanksta@
  @P.verb_theme.i@
  @P.verb_theme.a@
  @P.iotation.surface@
  @P.iotation.leveled@
